recommend keep-going — two of the four held spenders are proven (compress, gate); the next crux is stereo_limit_env_hold (the brickwall at infinite ratio, mirror of the held mono limiter) then stereo_expand_env_hold, closing the stereo held-dynamics quartet, single-module, policy written, no seam.
